Third-party software bundled with DeSent.
=========================================

Each entry below ships inside app/src/main/assets/lists/. The DeSent spam
filter (see refs/SPAM_FILTER_REFERENCE.md) loads these at first run so the
filter is useful before any NIP-51 manifest is fetched and before the user
trains the Bayesian layer.

